{"id":"memorial_103304","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103300","label":"Memoirs · The Cursed Crystals.txt"},"label":"Tinkling","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_103303","next":"memorial_103305","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103304_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"Another Nikke died suddenly."},{"id":"memorial_103304_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"There we were, walking, and she just collapsed."},{"id":"memorial_103304_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"I heard a tinkling sound when she fell."},{"id":"memorial_103304_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"Not a bang or plop, but a distinct tinkling."},{"id":"memorial_103304_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"I thought it was because the crystal had dropped to the ground when she fell, but she had fallen backward and was still holding onto it firmly."},{"id":"memorial_103304_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"The last Nikke alive in the squad said she had heard the same sound as well."},{"id":"memorial_103304_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"After mourning her passing, we decided to conduct an autopsy."},{"id":"memorial_103304_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_04_description","text":"Inside, her body was full of crystals."}]}